# host/ref.py is shared with the 6502 port and also emits that port's stream,
# header table and 8-bit lookup tables.  This cartridge consumes none of them
# (tools/emit.py derives its own from the same reference), so they are not
# tracked -- only expected.json, which the internals check reads.
